{"id": "P6D-combo-00051", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:revealed:day", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "寅藏甲、丙、戊（本气在前）。\n年柱庚午：庚（阳干）午（阳支）；没有见到。\n月柱甲申：甲（阳干）申（阳支）；没有见到。\n时柱辛未：辛（阴干）未（阴支）；没有见到。\n所以，日支寅藏的天干甲、丙、戊没有在年、月、时三个天干中透出。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\": []}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00051", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:revealed:day", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-50", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00052", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:god_count:官杀", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "天干见我（甲）的偏财、正财、食神、伤官：乙、丙、丁、戊。\n日主甲木克乙木（我克），乙为阴干、甲为阳干，阴阳相异，故为正财。\n日主甲木生丙火（我生），丙为阳干、甲为阳干，阴阳相同，故为食神。\n日主甲木生丁火（我生），丁为阴干、甲为阳干，阴阳相异，故为伤官。\n日主甲木克乙木（我克），乙为阴干、甲为阳干，阴阳相异，故为正财。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":0}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00052", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:god_count:官杀", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-51", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00053", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:flow_stage:2035", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "癸为阴干，长生在卯，逆行：卯长生、寅沐浴、丑冠带、子临官、亥帝旺、戌衰、酉病、申死、未墓、午绝、巳胎、辰养、卯长生，故为：长生、沐浴、冠带、临官、帝旺、衰、病、死、墓、绝、胎、养。\n2035 年为乙卯年，地支卯；日主癸水生卯，卯为阴干，癸为阴干，阴阳相同，故为长生。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":\"长生\"}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00053", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:flow_stage:2035", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-52", "parsed": true, "correct": true}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00054", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:kong_positions", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "戊午在六十甲子中序数为 1，属甲午旬（甲午至癸卯），该旬十个地支用不到的两个是辰巳。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":[\"月柱\"]}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00054", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:kong_positions", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-53", "parsed": true, "correct": true}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00055", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:revealed:day", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "辰藏戊、乙、癸（本气在前）。\n戊土出现在年干庚寅（没有）；乙木出现在月干庚辰（没有）；癸水出现在日干壬辰（是，日主壬水生癸水）。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":[\"癸\"]}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00055", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:revealed:day", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-54", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00056", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:god_count:食伤", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "年柱庚（比肩）戌（土）；月柱癸（食神）未（土）；日柱庚（比肩）戌（土）；时柱己（食神）卯（木）。所以是三个。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":3}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00056", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:god_count:食伤", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-55", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00057", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:flow_stage:2031", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "日主辛属金。金的长生在子，顺行：子长生、丑沐浴、寅冠带、卯临官、辰帝旺、巳衰、午病、未死、申墓、酉绝、戌胎、亥养，故为长生在子。\n2031 年为辛卯年，地支卯本气属木；木克金，令克者死。本项目以地支本气五行当令，其他分法可能不同。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":\"死\"}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00057", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:flow_stage:2031", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-56", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00058", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:kong_positions", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "年柱、月柱、时柱的地支两两比对，空亡地支按月柱起始地支推算，其余三支是否与之重合，取决于它们是否在同属一个地支的六十甲子中。\n年柱庚戌：地支戌；月柱丙戌：地支戌；时柱庚午：地支午。\n三支中没有一个被另一个完全覆盖，所以空亡地支没有出现。\n结论JSON: [\"\"]", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00058", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:kong_positions", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-57", "parsed": false, "correct": false}}
{"id": "P6D-combo-00059", "label": "p2", "split": "dev6", "part": "combo", "level": "L0", "intent": "combo:revealed:year", "source": "combo", "raw_output": "寅藏甲、丙、戊（本气在前）。\n年干庚与之无干系；月干戊与之无干系；时干己与之无干系。\n所以，没有天干同时出现在年、月、日、时四柱。\n结论JSON: {\"answer\":[]}", "score": {"id": "P6D-combo-00059", "family": "combo", "intent": "combo:revealed:year", "source": "combo", "group": "combo:combo-58", "parsed": true, "correct": false}}
